      47.85,
      365.65,
      539.9,
      403.72
    ],
    "text": "IN terms of the powers vested in me under the Section 42 (2) of the Poisons, Opium and Dangerous Drugs Ordinance No.17 of 1929 (Chapter 549), I, Rajitha Senarathna, Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine do hereby amendthe Opium Board constituted for Puttalam District as follows :-",
